# Grouping of the jEAP Examples overview on the jEAP documentation site.
#
# Two kinds of lines:
#   <id> | <Label>     declares a group; groups are shown in the order declared
#   <repo> = <id>      places an example repository in a declared group
#
# Repositories not listed here (or listed with an undeclared id) are shown under
# "Other", so a new example never disappears from the overview.

messaging       | Messaging
security        | Security
cdct            | Contract Testing (CDCT)
storage-search  | Storage and Search
process         | Process and Archive
platform        | Platform Services
misc            | Miscellaneous

